  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The ratio of escape velocity of a planet to the escape velocity of earth will be:-</p><p>Given: Mass of the planet is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math> times mass of earth and radius of the planet is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> times the radius of earth.</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula to calculate the escape velocity is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>For the Earth, it is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>E</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>&nbsp;and, for the planet, it is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>P</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Divide equation (2) by equation (3) and simplify to obtain the required ratio.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>E</mi></msup><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>P</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (4) to obtain the required ratio.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>E</mi></msup><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>P</mi></msup></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><mrow><mn>16</mn><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>E</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo></mtd><mtd><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>P</mi></msup><mo>:</mo><msup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>E</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p>"
  }
